title: The Red Army of Bavaria
subtitle: Egelhofer needs men, rifles and officers.
view-if: crisis_bavaria = 1 and bav_red_army_done = 0 and bav_power != 2
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; bav_red_army_done = 1
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: crisis

= The Red Army of Bavaria

Munich has a few thousand armed workers, some regiments of the old garrison that elected their own officers, and a great many speeches. Egelhofer wants every worker armed. The former officers who came over want ranks and drill.

- @arm_all: Arm every worker who will take a rifle.
- @officers: Give the army officers and discipline.
- @disarm: Disarm the bourgeoisie and take hostages.

@arm_all
subtitle: Many rifles, little training.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e19_bav_army += 8;
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
Q.crisis_line_3 = 'Red Army: ' + Q.e19_bav_army + ',000 men';
!}

Rifles are handed out at the factory gates against a council stamp. By the end of the week the Red Army has twenty thousand names on its lists.

@officers
subtitle: A smaller army that will stand when the shooting starts. The anarchists will protest.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e19_bav_army += 4;
Q.e19_bav_trained = 1;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
Q.ultraleft_satisfaction -= 4;
Q.crisis_line_3 = 'Red Army: ' + Q.e19_bav_army + ',000 men';
!}

@disarm
subtitle: Rifles from the villas of Bogenhausen, and hostages the Whites will hear about.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e19_bav_army += 5;
Q.bav_hostages = 1;
Q.lean_ultraleft += 2;
Q.crisis_line_3 = 'Red Army: ' + Q.e19_bav_army + ',000 men';
!}

Red Guards search the villas for weapons and take their owners away for questioning. Some are not released.
